							"content:textarea:19:45": {
								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p>In this 2-week job readiness program participants will create a resume, as well as templates for a cover letter and thank your letter; formulate a “30-second commercial\" to effectively answer that dreaded interview question, “Tell me a little about yourself?\"; become familiar with 21st century job search techniques; brush up on interview skills and participate in mock interviews designed to ensure the participant conveys his message effectively to an employer. Participants must be work ready – be able to present a valid state ID and Social Security Card and have no pending court cases that will interfere with employment and be able to pass a drug screen.&nbsp;</p>",
								"description": "Mixed Plain and Rich Text",
								"draggable": true,
								"content": "In this 2-week job readiness program participants will create a resume, as well as templates for a cover letter and thank your letter; formulate a “30-second commercial\" to effectively answer that dreaded interview question, “Tell me a little about yourself?\"; become familiar with 21st century job search techniques; brush up on interview skills and participate in mock interviews designed to ensure the participant conveys his message effectively to an employer. Participants must be work ready – be able to present a valid state ID and Social Security Card and have no pending court cases that will interfere with employment and be able to pass a drug screen.&nbsp;",
								"position": 9,
								"fullName": "content:textarea:19:45",
								"htmlElement": "p",
